      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents highlight the gentle care given to senior and anxious dogs during mobile and salon appointments. Reviewers note that groomers work calmly to keep pets relaxed throughout nail trims and baths. Aside from an isolated complaint about a shaved coat, owners feel confident leaving their companions in safe hands."
      }
    }
